Z||000000||AgaricX||10-30-2001||11:06 PM||||I'm about to relocate the battery to a position under the spare in prep for engine modification.  Does anybody have this done?  I've got the dimensions and the tray made, but whats the best way to run the wires?  Does anybody have pics of the install process?<P>Thanks!!||||reg||5
